                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Cooper was the sister of <persName key="COO01">Thomas Cooper</persName> (who was a cousin and pupil of Godwin's who went on to be an acclaimed actor).
    There are entries to Miss Cooper, Miss E Cooper, Miss E P Cooper, EPC, E P Cooper, E Cooper and so on, but we have assumed these are variants for a single person.
    Many of the contacts are associated with her mother <persName key="COO02">Grace Mary Cooper</persName></p>
                        <p>Godwin also records her death and funeral.</p>
